+        graphs gather), in ``pool`` (default a new one; the engine passes its graphs' pool). ``most``: the most
+        tokens a stream sees (the buckets past it are never used); ``mode``: ``graph_mode``; ``rows`` / ``nts``:
+        only these (tests). Returns the graphs' count. Before any stream is admitted (``_dummy`` writes the pool's
+        first rows)."""
